{
  "$description": "Density profile 'tv' (DSN-002): TV / 10-foot UI (tvOS, Android TV, desktop Big Picture). 1920×1080 pt canvas, 1 pt = 1 px. Type follows tvOS HIG sizes (min 23, default body 29) with Inter; reference platform (01 §4.10 п.6). Overrides scale-dependent roles only, never colours. Every density file defines the same set of tokens.",
